# Declarative herdr plugin set. Synced by `make herdr`.
# One `herdr plugin install` spec per line: owner/repo[/subdir] [--ref REF]
# Lines starting with # and blank lines are ignored.
# To update a pin: run `herdr plugin install owner/repo` (moves pin to latest),
# then copy the new commit sha into the --ref below.
